    <data name="FaqKicker" xml:space="preserve">
        <value>Questions</value>
    </data>
    <data name="FaqTitle" xml:space="preserve">
        <value>Before your first order</value>
    </data>
    <data name="Faq1Question" xml:space="preserve">
        <value>How much does click and collect cost?</value>
    </data>
    <data name="Faq1Answer" xml:space="preserve">
        <value>Nothing on orders over €40. Below that it costs €2. Prices are the same as on the shelf.</value>
    </data>
    <data name="Faq2Question" xml:space="preserve">
        <value>How late can I order for today?</value>
    </data>
    <data name="Faq2Answer" xml:space="preserve">
        <value>Up to two hours before your slot. Slots start every hour from 10:00, and the last one is 20:00 to 21:00.</value>
    </data>
    <data name="Faq3Question" xml:space="preserve">
        <value>What if something is out of stock?</value>
    </data>
    <data name="Faq3Answer" xml:space="preserve">
        <value>You decide for each item: a similar product at the same price or lower, or nothing at all. You only pay for what ends up in your bags.</value>
    </data>
    <data name="Faq4Question" xml:space="preserve">
        <value>Can I use the Northside Card in the shop?</value>
    </data>
    <data name="Faq4Answer" xml:space="preserve">
        <value>Yes. Open the card in the app and scan it at any till. Points and vouchers work the same in the shop and with click and collect.</value>
    </data>
    <data name="Faq5Question" xml:space="preserve">
        <value>Do I need the app?</value>
    </data>
    <data name="Faq5Answer" xml:space="preserve">
        <value>You can order on the web too, with the same slots and offers. The Northside Card is in the app.</value>
    </data>
